    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i checked the base and a couple of the roots are definitely pretty mushy and dark. it's honestly kind of creepy how quickly it's spreading through the pot. it almost feels like there's some kind of unseen force just eating away at it from the bottom up. could it be some kind of parasite or something living in the dirt that i can't see?",
